      "title": "The Note on the Door",
      "body": "When Maya got home, there was a note on her door. It was from her neighbour, asking her to move her car before seven in the morning because a delivery lorry needed the space. Maya had planned to sleep late, but she moved the car that night and left a friendly note back.",
