      "body": "Omar had twelve minutes to change trains. The board listed his connection at platform nine, so he walked there and waited. At the last moment an announcement moved it to platform two, at the far end of the station. He ran, and made it with seconds to spare, but his suitcase did not: a wheel broke on the stairs.",
