      "body": "Two surveys asked the same town about the same new road. One asked whether residents supported improving access to the hospital; the other asked whether they supported building through the woods. Support was seventy per cent in the first and thirty in the second. Both descriptions were accurate. The council quoted whichever number suited the meeting it was in.",
